    "detailed_description": "Captain Macaw is an old school platform adventure in the style of the ZX Spectrum classics.<br />\r\nThe graphical style closely resembles but not 100% emulate the ZX spectrum resolution and palette.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCaptain MaCaw was returning from a voyage when treacherous weather engulfed his ship.<br />\r\nScrambling for the life boat, he managed to escape just as the Jolly Roger vanished into the abyss.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWashed aboard a lost island with his life boat in ruin, Captain MaCaw must platform, collect and puzzle<br />\r\nhis way round this unfamiliar island.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe creatures on the island are not all out to kill you, but most are so take a helping hand when it is offered<br />\r\nand you may make it off this accursed island yet!",
    "about_the_game": "Captain Macaw is an old school platform adventure in the style of the ZX Spectrum classics.<br />\r\nThe graphical style closely resembles but not 100% emulate the ZX spectrum resolution and palette.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCaptain MaCaw was returning from a voyage when treacherous weather engulfed his ship.<br />\r\nScrambling for the life boat, he managed to escape just as the Jolly Roger vanished into the abyss.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWashed aboard a lost island with his life boat in ruin, Captain MaCaw must platform, collect and puzzle<br />\r\nhis way round this unfamiliar island.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe creatures on the island are not all out to kill you, but most are so take a helping hand when it is offered<br />\r\nand you may make it off this accursed island yet!",
